ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}No hace falta que saques
{{TAG:0005:0010:0000}} ni nada de eso.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}A no ser que tú quieras, claro.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Tu casa es muy acogedora, flor!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}
Me encantaría visitarte otro día,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wie viele Zimmer hast du denn?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Von außen sieht dein Haus
geräumiger aus...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}I'm so embarrassed about the mess.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Please look straight ahead and
ignore the dust bunnies,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} OK?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Scusa il disordine! Sono così
imbarazzata.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Tu mettiti comod{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
e non fare caso alla polvere!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Bu dağınıklık yüzünden çok utanıyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Lütfen dümdüz karşıya bak ve toz
yumaklarını görmezden gel,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} olur mu?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wie schön, dass du mich besuchst!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gäste sind mir stets willkommen,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'in evine bayılmıyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}
Buradaki dekorasyon fikirlerinin
birkaçını kesin kendi evime aşıracağım.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}This place just feels like home,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
doesn't it? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} really knows
how to decorate.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Questa casa è molto accogliente,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
non trovi? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} ha un gusto
che definirei sopraffino.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Burası insanın kendi evi gibi geliyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
değil mi? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
dekorasyondan gerçekten anlıyor.

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Millet,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hepimiz eğleniyoruz, biliyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama etrafı fazla dağıtmamaya dikkat edelim.
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Annem gibi konuştum.
